b><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9536-9539">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9539-9551"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9551-9560">ると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9560-9575"><rb>急</rb><rt>いそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9575-9578">ぎ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9578-9593"><rb>足</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9593-9611">にアトリエの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9611-9626"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9626-9629">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9629-9641"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9641-9647">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9647-9659"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9659-9672">つた。</seg></p>
