      <p source="#source-10458-10616">「さあ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10470-10491"><rb>夏繪</rb><rt>なつゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10491-10494">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10494-10515"><rb>今度</rb><rt>こんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10515-10527">はうまく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10527-10539"><rb>受</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10539-10542">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10542-10554"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby>るんだぞ。そら、ワン、ツウ、スリイ‥‥」</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-10616-11101"><seg source="#source-10616-10625">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10625-10643"><rb>夫</rb><rt>をつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10643-10652">は四五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10652-10670"><rb>間</rb><rt>けん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10670-10685"><rb>向</rb><rt>むか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10685-10691">うに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10691-10703"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10703-10715">つてゐる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10715-10736"><rb>子供</rb><rt>こども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10736-10739">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10739-10754"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10754-10757">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10757-10772"><rb>色</rb><rt>いろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10772-10790">どりしたゴム</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10790-10805"><rb>鞠</rb><rt>まり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10805-10808">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10808-10820"><rb>投</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10820-10835">げた。が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10835-10856"><rb>夏繪</rb><rt>なつゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10856-10859">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10859-10880"><rb>息込</rb><rt>いきご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10880-10907">んでゐたのがまたも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10907-10919"><rb>受</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10919-10922">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10922-10934"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10934-10952">りそこねて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10952-10967"><rb>鞠</rb><rt>まり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10967-10970">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10970-10994"><rb>色彩</rb><rt>しきさい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10994-10997">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10997-11012"><rb>躍</rb><rt>をど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11012-11039">らしながらうしろの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11039-11060"><rb>樹蔭</rb><rt>こかげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11060-11078">へころがつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11078-11090"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11090-11101">つた。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-11101-11190"><seg source="#source-11101-11104">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11104-11122"><rb>駄目</rb><rt>だめ</rt></ruby>よ、パパア。そんなにひどくはふつちやア‥‥」</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-11190-11330"><seg source="#source-11190-11199">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11199-11220"><rb>夏繪</rb><rt>なつゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11220-11223">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11223-11238"><rb>紺</rb><rt>こん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11238-11256">のスカアトを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11256-11277"><rb>飜</rb><rt>ひるがへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11277-11289">しながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11289-11304"><rb>鞠</rb><rt>まり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11304-11307">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11307-11319"><rb>追</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11319-11330">つた。</seg></p>
