by type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18331-18355"><rb>警戒</rb><rt>けいかい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18355-18376">し、なほも二三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18376-18391"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18391-18409"><rb>蜘蛛</rb><rt>くも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18409-18412">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18412-18433"><rb>死骸</rb><rt>しがい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18433-18436">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18436-18460"><rb>存在</rb><rt>そんざい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18460-18478">をたしかめに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18478-18490"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18490-18501">つた。</seg></p>
