      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-21517-22185"><seg source="#source-21517-21526">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21526-21541"><rb>話</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21541-21544">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21544-21556"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21556-21571">かせてゐる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21571-21586"><rb>内</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21586-21592">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21592-21610"><rb>夫</rb><rt>をつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21610-21613">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21613-21631"><rb>頭</rb><rt>あたま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21631-21634">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21634-21649"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21649-21661">には二三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21661-21679"><rb>日</rb><rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21679-21694"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21694-21697">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21697-21712"><rb>妻</rb><rt>つま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21712-21718">との</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21718-21739"><rb>對話</rb><rt>たいわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21739-21742">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21742-21760"><rb>不意</rb><rt>ふい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21760-21763">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21763-21778"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21778-21781">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21781-21796"><rb>浮</rb><rt>うか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21796-21802">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21802-21814"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21814-21820">た。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="righ